68\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 1em; letter-spacing: -0.005em;\"><span id=\"57a864f6-e9c2-4b1f-ab29-5e28362188dc\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-mark-type=\"annotation\" data-mark-annotation-type=\"inlineComment\" data-id=\"57a864f6-e9c2-4b1f-ab29-5e28362188dc\">Finger Dexterity — The ability to make precisely coordinated movements of the fingers of one or both hands to grasp, manipulate, or assemble very small objects.</span></p></li></ul><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: -0.005em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" segoe=\"\"><br> Required Work Experience : Beauty Advisor</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: -0.005em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" segoe=\"\"><br> Degree : Master of Fine Arts - MFA | Bachelor of Arts - BA</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: -0.005em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" segoe=\"\"><br>Required Knowledge : </p><ul class=\"ak-ul\" data-indent-level=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 24px; display: flow-root; color: rgb(23, 43, 77); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, 'Droid Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><li><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3968\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 1em; letter-spacing: -0.005em;\"><span id=\"57a864f6-e9c2-4b1f-ab29-5e28362188dc\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-mark-type=\"annotation\" data-mark-annotation-type=\"inlineComment\" data-id=\"57a864f6-e9c2-4b1f-ab29-5e28362188dc\">Administration and Management — Knowledge of business and management principles involved in strategic planning, resource allocation, human resources modeling, leadership technique, production methods, and coordination of people and resources.</span></p></li><li><p data-renderer-start