padding: 0px; font-size: 1em; letter-spacing: -0.005em;\"><span id=\"57a864f6-e9c2-4b1f-ab29-5e28362188dc\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-mark-type=\"annotation\" data-mark-annotation-type=\"inlineComment\" data-id=\"57a864f6-e9c2-4b1f-ab29-5e28362188dc\">Extend extensive beauty product knowledge to customers.</span></p></li><li><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3968\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 1em; letter-spacing: -0.005em;\"><span id=\"57a864f6-e9c2-4b1f-ab29-5e28362188dc\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-mark-type=\"annotation\" data-mark-annotation-type=\"inlineComment\" data-id=\"57a864f6-e9c2-4b1f-ab29-5e28362188dc\">Prepare reports on returned and / or damaged beauty products.</span></p></li><li><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3968\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 1em; letter-spacing: -0.005em;\"><span id=\"57a864f6-e9c2-4b1f-ab29-5e28362188dc\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-mark-type=\"annotation\" data-mark-annotation-type=\"inlineComment\" data-id=\"57a864f6-e9c2-4b1f-ab29-5e28362188dc\">Promote and sell beauty products of the company to customers who walk – in.</span></p></li><li><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3968\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 1em; letter-spacing: -0.005em;\"><span id=\"57a864f6-e9c2-4b1f-ab29-5e28362188dc\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-mark-type=\"annotation\" data-mark-annotation-type=\"inlineComment\" data-id=\"57a864f6-e9c2-4b1f-ab29-5e28362188dc\">Attend and respond to customer queries on beauty products to enhance sales.</span></p></li><li><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3968\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 1em; letter-spacing: -0.005em;\"><span id=\"57a864f6-e9c2-4b1f-ab29-5e28362188dc\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-mark-type=\"annotation\" data-mark-annotation-type=\"inlineComment\" data-id=\"57a864f6-e9c2-4b1f-ab29-5e28362188dc\">Meet and maximize sales targets and established goals.</span></p></li></ul><p><br><br></p>",
